CHAPTER.VERS:
For thus says Yahweh, You

          {+}
         were sold for nothing; and you

          {+}
         will be redeemed without money.

Break forth into joy, sing together, you

          {+}
         waste places of Jerusalem; for Yahweh has comforted his people, he has redeemed Jerusalem.

Depart

          {+}
        , depart

          {+}
